 {id:'Qingling',key:'qingling',no:'02',city:'Qingling',title:'The flood that arrived after the rain',terrain:'Hillside / Flow paths & timing',time:'36 HOURS BEFORE THE DRILL',image:'02-qingling-slope',person:'operator',question:'The rain stopped uphill. Why is the foot of the slope still flooding?',quote:'Rain stopped at the ridge at 14:10. The junction started flooding at 14:20. A facility must intercept the actual flow path.',clues:['elevation','tracer','camera'],
